= University of Colorado School of Medicine - Prompt 01

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Leadership / Curiosity / Commitment
- Limit: 500 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024 archive on Admit.org
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/university-of-colorado-school-of-medicine
- Local notes file: prompt-01.local.md

#section_label("Prompt text")
The pillars of our curriculum are Leadership, Curiosity, and Commitment. Tell us about how you have embodied one or more of these attributes in your path to medicine thus far. In which of these areas do you see the most opportunity for personal growth and why?

#section_label("Shared backbone files")
